//
// The base schema every app starts from, written with Kysely's schema builder so the SAME migration runs on SQLite
// and on MySQL. Portable column rules (follow them in your own migrations):
//   ids          varchar(36)  — generated by the app (newId()), never auto-increment
//   timestamps   varchar(24)  — ISO-8601 UTC strings (now()); identical on both engines, sortable as text
//   json         text         — JSON.stringify / JSON.parse in the repository (toJson / fromJson)
